      "typical_award_size": "HCD CY 2024-2028 Formula Allocation NOFA: Solano County CY 2024 $569,130 and CY 2025 $596,313; five-year estimate 2024-2028 $3,557,063. Earlier: 2020 award $128,234; 2023 allocation $560,188 (Five-Year Plan amendment affirmed by the Board July 23, 2024). Cities of Fairfield ($390,910 in 2021), Vacaville and Vallejo ($505,369 in 2021) receive their own entitlement shares (Pass 3).",
